    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d107">

                <pb facs="0147" n="131" xml:id="pg131"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">831.00/11–2748: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Venezuela</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Donnelly</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-11-27">November 27,
                        1948</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>906. Caracas quiet this morning with business returning normal, some sporadic
                    shooting last night but much less than previous nights, horse races to be
                    resumed today and bull fight tomorrow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Donnelly</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
